          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "澄设发〔2021〕9号",
            "bbox": [
              0.4192100717240021,
              0.18156770176105996,
              0.5875125147715337,
              0.20152019944723315
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "关于印发《差旅费管理办法（2021 版）》的通知",
            "bbox": [
              0.20156134597393646,
              0.2309441826972146,
              0.8051613174566702,
              0.2592102195757868
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "集团各部门、各设计院、分公司：",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.2798456114997773,
              0.43025210084033616,
              0.2997981091859505
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "《差旅费管理办法（2021 版）》已经集团总裁办公会审议通过，现印发给你们，",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.3095368229012025,
              0.876490796513918,
              0.3294893024652984
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "请认真遵照执行。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.33447744047839967,
              0.28907563025210087,
              0.35442992004249557
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
