        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "差旅费管理办法（2021 版）",
            "bbox": [
              0.33013277454536505,
              0.08783254374234524,
              0.6765898888852416,
              0.11609857155987882
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第一章 总则",
            "bbox": [
              0.4504201680672269,
              0.13673396348386932,
              0.5563025210084034,
              0.15668645210900387
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第一条 为规范澄川建筑工程设计集团有限公司（以下简称\"集团\"）差旅费管理，",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.16642518394633313,
              0.8752000311843487,
              0.18637768163250631
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "厉行节约，合理控制费用支出，制定本办法。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.19136580152353028,
              0.5310924369747899,
              0.21131829920970346
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第二条 本办法适用于集团总部及各设计院、分公司全体在岗员工。",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.22105701292495547,
              0.7579831932773109,
              0.24100951061112863
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本办法所称差旅费，是指员工临时到常驻工作地以外地区因公出差发生的城市间",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.25074822432638066,
              0.8739495798319328,
              0.2707007220125538
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "交通费、住宿费、伙食补助费和市内交通费。项目差旅费计入项目成本。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.2756888419035778,
              0.773109243697479,
              0.295641339589751
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第三条 财务部是差旅费归口管理部门，负责本办法的制定、解释和差旅费报销审",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.30538005330500295,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.32533253286909886
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "核；各部门负责人对本部门出差事项的必要性负责。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.33032067088220013,
              0.5915966386554622,
              0.35027315044629603
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第二章 出差审批",
            "bbox": [
              0.43025210084033616,
              0.36476247610785334,
              0.5764705882352941,
              0.38471495567194924
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第四条 员工出差前应填写出差审批单，经部门负责人审批后方可出差。部门负责",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.3944536875092785,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.4144061670733744
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "人出差由分管领导审批。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.4193943050864756,
              0.3495798319327731,
              0.43934678465057153
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第五条 因紧急情况来不及事前审批的，应在返回后及时补办审批手续。",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.44908551648790085,
              0.7983193277310925,
              0.46903799605199675
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第六条 各部门应严格控制出差人数和天数，不得无实质内容出差。出差人员应按",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.478776727889326,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.4987292074534219
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "批准行程执行，因私绕道发生的费用由个人承担。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.5037173454665231,
              0.5714285714285714,
              0.5236698250306191
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "出差审批单应写明出差事由、地点、起止日期、人数和交通方式。能够通过电",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.5334085568679483,
              0.853781512605042,
              0.5533610364320443
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "话、视频会议解决的事项，原则上不安排出差。单次出差超过 15 天的，须报分管领",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.5583491744451455,
              0.8626150948660715,
              0.5783016540092414
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "导审批。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.5832897920223427,
              0.20840336134453782,
              0.6032422715864385
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第三章 城市间交通费",
            "bbox": [
              0.41008403361344536,
              0.6177315972479959,
              0.5966386554621849,
              0.6376840768120917
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第七条 城市间交通费凭票据实报销。乘坐标准：集团领导及高级职称人员可乘坐",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.647422808649421,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.6673752882135169
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "火车一等座或软卧、飞机经济舱；其他人员乘坐火车二等座或硬卧、飞机经济舱。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.6723634262266182,
              0.853781512605042,
              0.6923159057907141
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第八条 未按规定等级乘坐交通工具的，超出部分由个人自理。乘坐飞机应优先选",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.7020546376280433,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.7220071171921393
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "择折扣机票，随票购买的航空意外险每人每次限一份。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.7269952552052406,
              0.611764705882353,
              0.7469477347693364
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第四章 住宿费",
            "bbox": [
              0.4403361344537815,
              0.7614370604308937,
              0.5663865546218487,
              0.7813895399949896
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第九条 出差人员应在规定标准内选择住宿场所，住宿费凭发票在标准内据实报",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.7911282718323189,
              0.8588235294117647,
              0.8110807513964148
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "销。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.816068889409516,
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.8360213689736119
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第十条 住宿费标准按职级和城市类别核定（单位：元/人·天）：",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.8457601008109412,
              0.7478991596638656,
              0.8657125803750371
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "text": "",
            "bbox": [
              0.12823529283539586,
              0.8766626885082641,
              0.8784874154740021,
              0.9050474672778107
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": "<table><tr><td>职级</td><td>一类城市</td><td>二类城市</td><td>三类城市</td></tr></table>",
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "page_num": 3,
