            "type": "table",
            "text": "正高级: 副高级 | 520: 450 | 440: 380 | 380: 330\n正高级: 中级及以下 | 520: 400 | 440: 340 | 380: 300",
            "bbox": [
              0.12831932623513273,
              0.0855106888361045,
              0.8784033852798933,
              0.17180521550484337
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": "<table><tr><td>正高级</td><td>520</td><td>440</td><td>380</td></tr><tr><td>副高级</td><td>450</td><td>380</td><td>330</td></tr><tr><td>中级及以下</td><td>400</td><td>340</td><td>300</td></tr></table>",
            "row_texts": [
              "正高级: 副高级 | 520: 450 | 440: 380 | 380: 330",
              "正高级: 中级及以下 | 520: 400 | 440: 340 | 380: 300"
            ],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "城市类别划分：",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.1804988072773623,
              0.3092436974789916,
              0.20045130496353547
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "（一）一类城市：北京、上海、广州、深圳、南京、武汉；",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.21019001867878748,
              0.692436974789916,
              0.23014251636496066
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "（二）二类城市：其他省会城市（含杭州、成都）、计划单列市及苏州、无锡、",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.23988123008021267,
              0.8739495798319328,
              0.25983372776638586
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "宁波、青岛、厦门；",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.2648218476574098,
              0.3092436974789916,
              0.284774345343583
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "（三）三类城市：其余地区。",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.29451304093675773,
              0.43025210084033616,
              0.31446552050085363
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "澄川市按二类城市执行。",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.3242042523381829,
              0.3899159663865546,
              0.3441567319022788
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第十一条 超过标准的住宿费，超出部分由个人自理。两人以上同性别出差的，原",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.35389546373960806,
              0.8789915966386554,
              0.37384794330370397
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "则上合住。会议、培训由主办方统一安排住宿的，凭会议通知按实际发生额报销。",
            "bbox": [
              0.12773109243697478,
              0.37883608131680524,
              0.853781512605042,
              0.39878856088090114
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第五章 伙食补助与市内交通",
            "bbox": [
              0.3798319327731092,
              0.41327788654245845,
              0.626890756302521,
              0.43323036610655435
            ],
            "confidence": null,
            "html": null,
            "row_texts": [],
            "caption": null,
            "linear_text": null
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "第十二条 伙食补助按出差自然（日历）天数计算，标准为每人每天 80 元。接待",
            "bbox": [
              0.16806722689075632,
              0.4429690979438836,
              0.8676571116727941,
              0.4629215775079795
